<title>UK: LIFFE details Feb coffee certified stocks.</title>
<headline>LIFFE details Feb coffee certified stocks.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>LIFFE certified coffee stocks fell slightly to 2,801 five-tonne lots in February from 2,831 in January, the exchange said on Monday.</p>
<p>Breakdown of stocks held in LIFFE-nominated warehouses as at February 28 (in five-tonne lots):</p>
<p>   Ports		    February     January</p>
<p>   UK				2	     2</p>
<p>   Rotterdam		   153	   145</p>
<p>   Amsterdam		   nil	   nil</p>
<p>   Hamburg		     156	   138</p>
<p>   Bremen			134	   134</p>
<p>   Antwerp		   1,687	 1,640</p>
<p>   Le Harve		    263	   306</p>
<p>   Barcelona		   247	   247</p>
<p>   Trieste			 7	     8</p>
<p>   New York		     18	    30</p>
<p>   New Orleans		 134	   181</p>
<p>   Total		     2,801	 2,831</p>
<p>-- Jalil Hamid, London newsroom +44 171 542 4985</p>
